## Case: ask-reply
id: "ace.m2.p968.ask-reply"
tags: ["ace-m2", "scheduler", "plan-968"]
links: ["PLAN-968", "PLAN-1066"]

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
task Q {
    on {
        n int -> {
            reply(n + 1)
        }
    }
}
fn main() {
    let h = Task.spawn("Q", 16)
    let v = await h.ask(41)
    print("reply:")
    print(v)
}
```

